  "version": "0.7.0-alpha.7",
  "notes": "## 0.7.0-alpha.7 - 2026-05-10\n\n### Features\n\n- Mark history items whose saved content is gone as unavailable in the main history and quick panel before users try to reuse them.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Show a clear unavailable-content message for history items that can no longer be restored instead of a generic copy failure.\n- Finish saving large clipboard captures before adding them to history, reducing cases where an item appears after restart but cannot be reused.\n- Detect older broken history items on startup and mark them unavailable so repeated reuse attempts no longer produce generic failures.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.7.0-alpha.7 - 2026-05-10\n\n### Features\n\n- 主历史列表和快捷面板现在会将已无法恢复内容的历史项标记为“内容已不可用”，让用户在再次使用前就能识别。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 当历史项内容已不可恢复时，现在会显示明确的“内容已不可用”提示，而不是笼统的复制失败。\n- 大体积剪贴板内容会先完成保存再加入历史记录，减少重启后条目仍显示但无法再次使用的情况。\n- 启动时会识别旧版本留下的异常历史项并标记为不可用，避免用户反复尝试时只看到笼统失败。",
